  "description": "High-performance streaming hash library for .NET 10. All 70 algorithms fully accessible including MurmurHash3, CityHash, SpookyHash, SipHash, FarmHash, HighwayHash, MetroHash, KangarooTwelve, wyhash, xxHash, plus complete cryptographic suite (SHA-3, BLAKE, Keccak, RIPEMD, Whirlpool, Tiger, GOST, Streebog, Skein, SM3, Grøstl, JH). Features unified HashFacade API with batch streaming support for parallel multi-algorithm processing. Comprehensive test coverage (762+ tests). SIMD-optimized implementations for HighwayHash64 (AVX2), Grøstl (AES-NI), JH (SSSE3), and custom high-performance Whirlpool.",
